{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams, panic, and fear of the dentist\u2019s chair \u2014 who hasn\u2019t felt that wave of anxiety?<br>But now, the tables have turned \u2014 <strong>YOU are the one holding the drill!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the most realistic, immersive, and heart-pounding dentist simulator ever created. Grab your anesthetic syringe, forceps, and precision tools \u2014 every tooth is under your control. But beware: these sharp instruments demand skill, patience, and a steady hand. One wrong move, and your patients won\u2019t just scream \u2014 they\u2019ll bolt out the door!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master every thrilling detail of dental work:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administer anesthesia with surgical precision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/952150b95c8fb4d0b085fa9fc48417da.poster.avif?t=1758946549\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/952150b95c8fb4d0b085fa9fc48417da.webm?t=1758946549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/952150b95c8fb4d0b085fa9fc48417da.mp4?t=1758946549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillfully cut and retract gums</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/0982c968d94a2321d146f4eb1ba74769.poster.avif?t=1758946549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/0982c968d94a2321d146f4eb1ba74769.webm?t=1758946549\" type=\"vi