ay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/38f7067f256bb1455436ae5d3f781043.poster.avif?t=1758946549\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/38f7067f256bb1455436ae5d3f781043.webm?t=1758946549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/38f7067f256bb1455436ae5d3f781043.mp4?t=1758946549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft dazzling gold and silver teeth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/b890dadc53878e26e12e0371240f0015.poster.avif?t=1758946549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/b890dadc53878e26e12e0371240f0015.webm?t=1758946549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/b890dadc53878e26e12e0371240f0015.mp4?t=1758946549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install dental implants like a true professional</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/8536594260628a7a86f0d821443a7ea9.poster.avif?t=1758946549\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/8536594260628a7a86f0d821443a7ea9.webm?t=1758946549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940820/extras/8536594260628a7a86f0d821443a7ea9.mp4?t=1758946549\" type=\